<title>USA: Remec files to offer 2.25 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Remec files to offer 2.25 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Remec Inc said Friday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 2.25 million shares.</p>
<p>It said 1.75 million shares are being sold by the company and 500,000 are being sold by shareholders.</p>
<p>The offering is being made through an underwriting group managed by Needham &amp; Co Inc, A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons Inc and Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc.</p>
